/*
  CommandPalette.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0205 · CommandPalette (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The first blocks mirror the web
  `components/ui/CommandPalette.tsx` `t()` calls VERBATIM (same key, same English default), so the native
  palette resolves identical copy: the palette + search section headings, the vehicle-command labels, the
  recent-time buckets (whose web `{{count}}` interpolation becomes a `%d` placeholder), the scope chips +
  placeholders + empty messages, and the header / empty / footer copy (the `{{query}}` / `{{command}}` /
  `{{scope}}` interpolations become `%@`).

  The final block is native a11y + leaf-state copy the web gets "for free" from the DOM: the dialog role, the
  search-field label, the row hint, the back / close controls, the trigger label, and the loading / error /
  freshness chrome (the web has no `QueryError` / skeleton / stale-offline peer).

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in
  a per-surface table ("CommandPalette") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In test /
  preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping labels deterministic.
*/

